Main Bayaan Kaise Karu Meri Musibat Amma<br>
uthke Zainab (sa) Ki Zara Dekhlo Gurbat Amma<br>
<br>
1. Lutke Pardes Se Aayi Hoon Mai Amma Utho<br>
mujhpe Jo Guzri Hai Rudaad Sitam Ki Pucho<br>
har Qadam Maine Uthaayi Hai Aziyat Amma<br>
<br>
2. Jeete Ji Bhai Ke Gham Ne Mujhe Maara Dekho<br>
dedo Beti Ko Tumhaari Ye Sahaara Dedo<br>
khogayi Aankho'n Se Meri Ye Basaarat Amma<br>
<br>
3. Dar Badar Kucha O Bazaar Phiraaya Humko<br>
taaziyano'n Se Layeeno'n Ne Rulaaya Humko<br>
zulm Karti Rahi Nana Ki Ye Ummat Amma<br>
<br>
4. Mere Majaaye Ko Teero'n Pe Tadapte Dekha<br>
garm Rethi Pa Use Sar Ko Patakte Dekha<br>
aur Layee'n Naizo Se Dete The Aziyat Amma<br>
<br>
5. Kund Khanjar Liye Zalim Jo Chada Seene Par<br>
main Tadapti Rahi Chillati Rahi Ro Ro Kar<br>
ek Bahen Se Suno Bhai Ki Shahadat Amma<br>
<br>
6. Bhai Ka Lasha Mere Is Tarah Pamaal Hua<br>
ungliyaa'n Kat Gayi Mithi Pa Kaleja Dekha<br>
main Bayaa'n Kaise Karu Ab Nahi Himmat Amma<br>
<br>
7. Mere Abid (as) Ko Pinhaayi Gayi Bhaari Bedi<br>
mujhse Dekhi Nahi Jaati Thi Wo Gurbat Uski<br>
main Bacha Laayi Hoon Sholo'n Se Imamat Amma<br>
<br>
8. Mera Qasim (as) Nahi Abbas E Dilawar Bhi Nahi<br>
margaye Aon O Mohd (as) Mera Akbar (as) Bhi Nahi<br>
main Bana Aayi Hoon Har Ek Ki Turbat Amma<br>
<br>
9. Tum Azadaare Shahe Dee'n Ko Duayei'n Dena<br>
apne Rumaal Me Le Lena Har Ek Ashk E Aza<br>
<b>Kazmi</b> Ne Hai Likhi Meri Musibat Amma